# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Vendor Security Management Program
**Document ID**: SEC-010
**Classification**: Internal
**Last Updated**: January 2025

---

## Program Overview

MedSync Health's Vendor Security Management Program ensures that third-party vendors meet our security and compliance requirements before and during the engagement lifecycle.

---

## Vendor Classification

### Risk Tiers

| Tier | Criteria | Assessment | Review Cycle |
|------|----------|------------|--------------|
| Tier 1 - Critical | PHI access, production systems | Full assessment + SOC 2 | Annual |
| Tier 2 - High | PII access, business critical | Standard assessment + SOC 2 | Annual |
| Tier 3 - Medium | Internal data, moderate access | Abbreviated assessment | Biennial |
| Tier 4 - Low | No sensitive data, limited access | Questionnaire only | Triennial |

### Classification Criteria

| Factor | Tier 1 | Tier 2 | Tier 3 | Tier 4 |
|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|
| PHI Access | Yes | No | No | No |
| PII Access | Yes | Yes | No | No |
| Production Access | Yes | Possible | No | No |
| Business Critical | Yes | Yes | Possible | No |
| Data Volume | High | Medium | Low | None |

