## Assessment Process

### New Vendor Assessment

| Step | Action | Owner | Timeline |
|------|--------|-------|----------|
| 1 | Business request | Requester | — |
| 2 | Tier classification | Security | 1 day |
| 3 | Security questionnaire | Vendor | 5-10 days |
| 4 | Documentation review | Security | 3-5 days |
| 5 | Risk assessment | Security | 2-3 days |
| 6 | Approval/Rejection | Security + Business | 1-2 days |
| 7 | Contract/BAA | Legal/Procurement | Varies |
| 8 | Onboarding | IT/Business | Varies |

### Assessment Requirements by Tier

| Requirement | Tier 1 | Tier 2 | Tier 3 | Tier 4 |
|-------------|--------|--------|--------|--------|
| Security Questionnaire | Full (150 Q) | Standard (80 Q) | Basic (30 Q) | Minimal (10 Q) |
| SOC 2 Type II | Required | Required | Preferred | Optional |
| HITRUST | Preferred | Optional | N/A | N/A |
| Penetration Test | Required | Preferred | Optional | N/A |
| BAA | Required | As needed | N/A | N/A |
| Insurance Review | Required | Required | Optional | N/A |
| On-site Audit | Optional | N/A | N/A | N/A |

