## Security Requirements

### Minimum Security Requirements (All Tiers)

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Encryption at Rest | AES-256 or equivalent |
| Encryption in Transit | TLS 1.2+ |
| Multi-Factor Authentication | Required for admin access |
| Access Control | Role-based access |
| Incident Response | Documented plan |
| Security Contact | Designated contact |

### Additional Requirements (Tier 1-2)

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| SOC 2 Type II | Current (within 12 months) |
| Vulnerability Management | Regular scanning + patching |
| Background Checks | For personnel with access |
| Data Retention | Defined policies |
| Breach Notification | < 72 hours |
| Security Training | Annual for all staff |

### PHI-Specific Requirements (Tier 1)

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| BAA Execution | Required before access |
| HIPAA Training | Required for personnel |
| Audit Logging | Access to PHI logged |
| Data Minimization | Minimum necessary |
| Secure Disposal | Documented procedures |
| Subcontractor Flow-down | Required |

